{"ref":"BDB, תֶּ֫בֶל","hw":"תֶּ֫בֶל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">תֶּ֫בֶל</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>confusion</strong>, violation of nature, or the divine order—<a data-ref=\"Leviticus 18:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.18.23\">Lv 18:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 20:12\" href=\"/Leviticus.20.12\">20:12</a> (H) cf. Di on <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 18:15\" href=\"/Leviticus.18.15\">18:15</a>.","next":"BDB, תְּבַלֻּל","prev":"BDB, שַׁבְּלוּל"}